Hello. I am using openphi for my experiment. Adding this function can make it more compatible with openslide.
The code comes from here.
https://github.com/bayer-science-for-a-better-life/tiffslide/blob/main/tiffslide/tiffslide.py#L248
```python

def get_best_level_for_downsample(self, downsample: float) -> int:
    """return the best level for a given downsampling factor"""
    if downsample <= 1.0:
        return 0
    for lvl, ds in enumerate(self.level_downsamples):
        if ds > downsample:
            return lvl - 1
    return self.level_count - 1
```
